      "message": "I think it\u0027s better to point the choice option directly PLATFORM_EC_ACCELGYRO_BMI_COMM.  Users should be setting the choice option instead the SPI/I2C selection directly:\n\nconfig PLATFORM_EC_ACCELGYRO_BMI_COMM\n    default PLATFORM_EC_ACCELGYRO_BMI_COMM_I2C\n    \nI also wonder if we can auto-select the correct interface using one of the kconfigfunctions https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/blob/main/scripts/kconfig/kconfigfunctions.py",
